payload.description:
Caller-supplied JSON payload. Shape depends on the kind; conventional fields per kind:
- assertion: { label: string, detail: any }
- stage_enter / stage_exit: { stage: string, detail: any }
- measurement: { metric: string, detail: any (typically { value: number, unit: string, ... }) }
- error: { reason: string, detail: any }
- decision: { verdict: string, detail: any }
- evidence_emit: { claim_id: string, detail: any (typically a pointer to the emitted G47 evidence-stream sample) }
